strings.FAV_production_category_desc:
Maintaining a supply of material and aircraft is crucial to presenting a solid defense against the Germans. Aircraft may be produced below, and the progress of gathering scrap metal shall be tracked.
Stocked scrap metal: {FAVScrapMetalBank}
Projected monthly scrap metal gain: {FAVScrapMetalGain}
Number of Basic Aircraft: {FAVBasicAircraft}
Number of Advanced Aircraft: {FAVAdvancedAircraft}

We currently have {FAVRecruitedGround} Ground Crew, who produce 0.1 scrap metal each, and we are projected to recruit {FAVGroundGain} more per month.

Below, Basic Aircraft may be produced for 20 Scrap Metal, and Advanced Aircraft may be produced for 45 Scrap Metal.

strings.FAV_training_category_desc:
Our available manpower is low, and each worker and pilot is precious to us. Thus, maintaining a steady supply of recruits to either work as Ground Crew or Pilots is critically important. While Pilots are needed to fly planes against Germany, Ground Crew are necessary to maintain the ability to repair and manufacture aircraft.

